---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Bio" sideBarActiveItemID="bio">
    <div class="pb-12 mt-5">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Bio </h1>
        <div class="bio-text text-lg pt-4">
            <p>Christina Chaniotaki is a Ph.D. student in Computer Science at the <a href="https://www.usc.edu/" class="text-blue-500">University of Southern California</a>, advised by Prof. <a href="https://viterbi-web.usc.edu/~halfond/" class="text-blue-500">William G.J. Halfond</a>. Her research interests include software testing, program analysis, AI agents for security, and web services. Her work explores methods for identifying bugs and vulnerabilities to improve the security and reliability of software systems.</p>
            <p>Before her Ph.D., she gained over six years of software engineering experience,
                including senior and team leadership roles at <a href="https://ubitech.eu/" class="text-blue-500">UBITECH LTD</a> and the
                <a href="https://www.eba.europa.eu/homepage" class="text-blue-500">European Banking Authority (EBA)</a>, among others. \
                In summer 2025, she was an Applied Scientist II intern at
                <a href="https://aws.amazon.com/" class="text-blue-500">Amazon AWS</a>, working on authorization issue detection using AI agents.</p>
            <p>She received her bachelor’s degree from the <a href="https://www.dept.aueb.gr/en/dmst" class="text-blue-500">Department of Management Science and Technology</a> at <a href="https://www.aueb.gr/en" class="text-blue-500">Athens University of Economics and Business</a> in 2018, and her master’s degree in <a href="https://mscis.cs.aueb.gr/en/normal/home" class="text-blue-500">Information Systems</a> from the same university in 2021.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.bio-text p { margin:0 0 20px; }
</style>
